# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 9 as ruled (round 3 DY: a supplier's dynamic answer gives the place its first value in the birth tick, and each later change is a push delivered the next tick, which is owed).
test a_named_dynamic_answer

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="go")
    1/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="gauge 1")

tick 1
  in:
    0: click

tick 2
  changed:
    1/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="gauge 2")
